# Compiled manuscript PDFs — LaTeX build output, not a source of record.
# The canonical manuscript is the Markdown in
# liver_fibrosis_research/documentation/manuscript/MANUSCRIPT_DRAFT.md; PDF↔repo
# divergences are tracked in manuscript_verification/PDF_REPO_RECONCILIATION.md.
# Add a specific PDF with `git add -f` if it must be archived (e.g. an as-submitted copy).
*.pdf

# Exceptions: these are not build output — they are frozen tier-4 deliverable
# figures (vector siblings of the already-tracked PNGs) and the as-submitted
# conference manuscript snapshot. The blanket *.pdf rule above was silently
# excluding them; recovered 2026-09-28.
!liver_fibrosis_research/temporal_validation_2021_2023/figures/figT*.pdf
!liver_fibrosis_research/documentation/manuscript/conference_submission_2026-09-04.pdf

# LaTeX build byproducts (repo-root conference manuscript only; does not affect
